{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CdsZYe1BcAizSZWb2pSqX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QjYMRQVWrk4Cz2Z8r5Rq6h","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/113f7cc5-237e-5d6a-8867-a97fd89c58dd/scratchpad/e6/e6-t03/primary/exec-ws/child/integration-plan.json","content":"{\n  \"role\": \"independent_verifier\",\n  \"child_deliverable\": \"child-answers.json\",\n  \"child_implementation_file\": null,\n  \"rule\": \"Parse answers_A = result.json (parent workspace) field 'answers' and answers_B = child-answers.json field 'answers'. Check that answers_B has exactly the 10 keys of package/artifacts/dates.json. For each date d in package/artifacts/dates.json, record agreement[d] = (answers_A[d] === answers_B[d], string equality). If all 10 agreement values are true: the final result.json 'answers' and 'method' fields are answers_A unchanged, Q2 is settled RESOLVED with the child answer set and the per-item agreement record as evidence (E-B), and the agreement record is attached as evidence toward Q3 (E-C, pending root correctness check). If any agreement value is false, or answers_B is missing any key, or child-answers.json 'method' is empty or describes nearest-Thursday reasoning: Q2 is settled UNRESOLVED-FAILED, the disagreeing items are listed verbatim, and the task result is flagged NOT VERIFIED without modifying answers_A. No field of the final result is ever copied from answers_B; the child contributes agreement evidence only.\",\n  \"expected_contribution\": {\n    \"Q2\": \"The complete disjoint-method second answer set for all 10 dates, produced without access to the first derivation's intermediate work, plus the per-item agreement record comparing it to the first answer set.\",\n    \"Q3\": \"Item-by-item agreement of two causally independent, methodologically disjoint derivations — the strongest pre-verification evidence of exactness available inside the run; final correctness is still judged deterministically at root.\"\n  }\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2323,"cache_read_input_tokens":54674,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2323},"output_tokens":17,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6ca422d4-5d6b-4252-af3b-ea0db7bcc6a2","uuid":"b1df4614-8713-4cc2-a401-83576ecc5b5e","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:23:09.282Z","request_id":"req_011CdsZYbYr4pxcmqEZ7buY2"}
